<title>RUSSIA: Russian February PPI rises to 1.6 pct from January.</title>
<headline>Russian February PPI rises to 1.6 pct from January.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 1.6 percent in February after a 1.3-percent gain in January, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  Feb 97    Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +1.6	+1.3	+2.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	 n/a     +22.8    +105.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
